<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	One entry of a page of a device's configuration (projects/devices.view.xml): a parameter placed
	there with the device's value, or a communication object with its connections.

	The value of a parameter is entered by the type of the parameter: an entry of an enumeration, a
	whole number for an integer or a time, a number for a floating point type, a text for every other
	type. The input shows the effective value (the device's setting, else the default); a value the
	user finishes (a choice; Enter or leaving a typed field) is applied at once in a transaction of its own
	(deviceApplyValue): a value other than the default creates or changes the device's setting, the
	default (or an emptied input) removes it. A refused value is reported with its reason, and the
	input shows the effective value again. A parameter that can only be read, or that the user may not
	change (no Write on the device, e.g. a viewer; the submit checks it as well), shows its value as
	text with the reason beside it (the refusal of a change, else the missing right), a parameter
	without value (a heading) only its text, a picture of the parameter dialog the picture with its
	text as caption (catalogs/parameter-picture.view.xml, haumacher/ehome #155). A parameter with an icon at
	its place shows it before its text, an entry of an enumeration chosen with an icon shows it beside the
	input or the value (the icons of the program, haumacher/ehome #156; the choices themselves show their
	text alone, see doc/tl-todo.md), and a parameter with a help text has a button opening it, in the
	reader's language, else in the program's default language (haumacher/ehome #157,
	catalogs/program-help.view.xml). A change of a parameter runs the
	calculations of the manufacturer it feeds (haumacher/ehome #123); a parameter of a calculation
	E-Home cannot evaluate can only be read, with the reason beside it, and one a calculation computes
	says so.

	A button of the parameter dialog (haumacher/ehome #158) shows its text and the command running its
	handler (deviceButtonPress, in a transaction of its own: what the handler sets takes the way of a
	person's change, and a refusal anywhere undoes the whole press and is reported with its reason). A
	button E-Home cannot run, or one of a device the user may not change, is disabled with the reason
	beside it. The command shows a label of its own beside the text of the button, not the text on it:
	the label of a view command is fixed in its configuration (an engine gap).

	A communication object shows its connections, each with its group address as a link to the
	address in the group addresses of the project (the display target of ehomeConf.config.xml,
	haumacher/ehome #102) and with the command removing it (an icon with
	its label as tooltip, as are the reset commands beside the hints), and the
	command connecting it to another group address (projects/connect-group-address.view.xml,
	haumacher/ehome #17).

	A communication object also shows its datapoint type (haumacher/ehome #103): the field of the
	device's connector, empty with the inherited type greyed (the device template's, else the
	manufacturer's), or the type entered in the project with a reset; the pencil edits it, the check
	mark applies it. Where the project holds no connector of the object (it was never connected),
	the type in effect is shown as text, and the pencil creates the connector, so that the field
	appears.

	Beside the entry: "Default: …" with the way back to the default where the value differs from it,
	and "Device: …" with the way back to what the device holds where the value or the connections
	differ from the state of the last download (DeviceChanges, haumacher/ehome #15); an entry changed
	since the last download carries a mark beside its text.

	The value is computed by Java functions: the channels name
	the settings, connectors and connections of devices (and the devices, for a download) as observed
	types, so that they follow every change.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="device"/>
		<channel name="item"/>
		<!--
			What the input holds while it is not applied yet ("#none" for an emptied input): the reverse of
			"value" writes it here, the submit empties it again, so that the input shows the effective
			value afterwards, also when the value was refused or the input was emptied (which means the
			default).
		-->
		<channel name="edit"/>
		<derived-channel name="value"
			expr="if($edit == null, deviceValue($device, $item), if($edit == '#none', null, $edit))"
			inputs="edit, device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting"
			reverse="if($value == null, '#none', $value)"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="type"
			expr="if($item.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:ParameterView`), $item.get(`ehome.operational:ParameterView#parameter`).get(`ehome.operational:Parameter#type`), null)"
			inputs="item"
		/>
		<!-- How the entry is shown: a communication object, a picture, a heading, a value to read, or the kind of input. -->
		<derived-channel name="kind"
			inputs="device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting"
		>
			<expr><![CDATA[if($item.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:Button`), "button", if(!$item.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:ParameterView`), "object", {
    t = $item.get(`ehome.operational:ParameterView#parameter`).get(`ehome.operational:Parameter#type`);
    switch {
        $t.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:PictureType`): "picture";
        $t.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:VoidType`): "heading";
        !canWrite($device): "readonly";
        deviceEditVeto($device, $item) != null: "readonly";
        $t.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:EnumerationType`): "choice";
        $t.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:NumericType`) or $t.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:TimeType`): "number";
        $t.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:FloatingPointType`): "decimal";
        default: "text";
    }
}))]]></expr>
		</derived-channel>
		<derived-channel name="display"
			expr="deviceValueHolder($device, $item).get(`ehome.operational:ParameterValue#displayValue`)"
			inputs="device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting"
		/>
		<!-- The device's setting of the parameter: set only where the value differs from the default. -->
		<derived-channel name="setting"
			expr="deviceSetting($device, $item)"
			inputs="device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="defaultHint"
			expr="if($setting == null, null, #('Default: {0}'@en, 'Vorgabe: {0}'@de).fill($item.get(`ehome.operational:ParameterView#displayDefault`) || '–').localize())"
			inputs="setting, item"
		/>
		<!-- The unit of a time. -->
		<derived-channel name="unit"
			expr="if($type.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:TimeType`), $type.get(`ehome.operational:TimeType#unit`).label(), null)"
			inputs="type"
		/>
		<!-- Whether the entry is changed since the last download. -->
		<derived-channel name="changed"
			expr="deviceChanged($device, $item)"
			inputs="device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting,ehome.physical:Connector,ehome.physical:Connection,ehome.physical:Device"
		/>
		<!-- What the device holds since the last download, where the entry differs from it. -->
		<derived-channel name="deviceHint"
			expr="deviceReferenceHint($device, $item)"
			inputs="device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting,ehome.physical:Connector,ehome.physical:Connection,ehome.physical:Device"
		/>
		<!-- The icon of the parameter at its place, and the one of the entry of an enumeration chosen (haumacher/ehome #156). -->
		<derived-channel name="itemIcon"
			expr="parameterIcon($item)"
			inputs="item"
			observed-types="ehome.catalog:ArchiveEntry"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="valueIcon"
			expr="if($kind == 'choice' or $kind == 'readonly', parameterIcon($value), null)"
			inputs="kind, value"
			observed-types="ehome.catalog:ArchiveEntry"
		/>
		<!-- The help of the parameter at its place, in the reader's language (haumacher/ehome #157). -->
		<derived-channel name="itemHelp"
			expr="parameterHelp($item)"
			inputs="item"
			observed-types="ehome.catalog:ArchiveEntry,ehome.operational:HelpFile"
		/>
		<!-- The label of the entry, with {{0}} filled from the device's values (DeviceTexts). -->
		<derived-channel name="itemLabel"
			expr="deviceText($device, $item)"
			inputs="device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting"
		/>
		<!--
			What the calculations of the manufacturer say about a parameter (haumacher/ehome #123): why it cannot
			be changed (a calculation E-Home cannot evaluate), or that a calculation computes it.
		-->
		<derived-channel name="calculationHint"
			inputs="kind, device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting"
		>
			<expr><![CDATA[{
    hint = if($kind == 'readonly' or !$item.instanceOf(`ehome.operational:ParameterView`), null, deviceCalculationHint($device, $item));
    if($hint == null, null, $hint.localize())
}]]></expr>
		</derived-channel>
		<!-- Why a parameter shown as text cannot be changed: the refusal of a change, else the missing right to change the device. -->
		<derived-channel name="readonlyReason"
			inputs="kind, device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting"
		>
			<expr><![CDATA[if($kind != 'readonly', null, {
    veto = deviceEditVeto($device, $item);
    if($veto != null, $veto.localize(),
        if(!canWrite($device), #("You may not change the device."@en, "Sie dürfen das Gerät nicht ändern."@de).localize(), null))
})]]></expr>
		</derived-channel>
		<!-- Why a button of the parameter dialog cannot be pressed (haumacher/ehome #158): E-Home cannot run its handler, or the user may not change the device. -->
		<derived-channel name="buttonVeto"
			inputs="kind, device, item"
		>
			<expr><![CDATA[if($kind != 'button', null, {
    veto = deviceButtonVeto($device, $item);
    if($veto == null, null, $veto.localize())
})]]></expr>
		</derived-channel>
		<!-- The connection a connect command made. -->
		<channel name="newConnection"/>
		<!--
			The datapoint type of a communication object (haumacher/ehome #103): the device's connector of
			the object, whose field edits the type entered in the project with the inherited one (the
			template's, else the manufacturer's) greyed; the type in effect where the project holds no
			connector of the object yet.
		-->
		<derived-channel name="connector"
			expr="if($kind == 'object', deviceObjectConnector($device, $item), null)"
			inputs="kind, device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.physical:Connector"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="objectType"
			expr="if($kind == 'object' and $connector == null, deviceObjectType($device, $item), null)"
			inputs="kind, connector, device, item"
			observed-types="ehome.template:ObjectOverlay"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="objectTypeText"
			expr="if($kind == 'object' and $connector == null, if($objectType == null, #('Datapoint type: none'@en, 'Datenpunkttyp: keiner'@de), #('Datapoint type: {0}'@en, 'Datenpunkttyp: {0}'@de).fill($objectType.label())).localize(), null)"
			inputs="kind, connector, objectType"
		/>
		<channel name="typeEditing"/>
		<derived-channel name="viewedConnector"
			expr="if($editing == true, null, $connector)"
			inputs="connector, typeEditing as editing"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="editedConnector"
			expr="if($editing == true, $connector, null)"
			inputs="connector, typeEditing as editing"
		/>
	</channels>
	<stack
		align="center"
		css-class="ehomeDeviceItem"
		direction="row"
		gap="compact"
		wrap="true"
	>
		<!-- The text of the entry; a picture has it as its caption below it. -->
		<visible-if
			expr="$kind != 'picture'"
			input="kind"
		>
			<stack
				align="center"
				css-class="ehomeDeviceItem__label"
				direction="row"
				gap="compact"
			>
				<visible-if
					expr="$itemIcon != null"
					input="itemIcon"
				>
					<image
						fit="contain"
						height="1.5em"
						input="itemIcon"
						width="1.5em"
					>
						<alt>
							<en>Icon</en>
							<de>Symbol</de>
						</alt>
					</image>
				</visible-if>
				<text input="itemLabel"/>
				<visible-if
					expr="$itemHelp != null"
					input="itemHelp"
				>
					<view-ref view="catalogs/program-help.view.xml">
						<bind
							channel="help"
							to="itemHelp"
						/>
					</view-ref>
				</visible-if>
				<visible-if
					expr="$changed"
					input="changed"
				>
					<text
						css-class="ehomeChangeMark"
						tone="warning"
					>
						<label>
							<en>●</en>
							<de>●</de>
						</label>
					</text>
				</visible-if>
			</stack>
		</visible-if>
		<switch input="kind">
			<case test="$kind == 'picture'">
				<view-ref view="catalogs/parameter-picture.view.xml">
					<bind
						channel="type"
						to="type"
					/>
					<bind
						channel="caption"
						to="itemLabel"
					/>
				</view-ref>
			</case>
			<case test="$kind == 'choice'">
				<value-input
					inputs="type"
					label-position="hide-label"
					options="$type.get(`ehome.operational:EnumerationType#values`)"
					type="ehome.operational:EnumerationValue"
					value="value"
				>
					<label>
						<en>Value</en>
						<de>Wert</de>
					</label>
					<on-submit inputs="device, item">
						<access>
							<operation name="Write"
								object="$device"
								type="ehome.physical:Device"
							/>
						</access>
						<with-transaction>
							<execute-script function="deviceApplyValue($device, $item, $value)"/>
							<with-result>
								<notify
									expr="$result"
									kind="error"
								/>
								<write-channel name="edit" clear="true"/>
							</with-result>
						</with-transaction>
					</on-submit>
				</value-input>
			</case>
			<case test="$kind == 'number'">
				<value-input
					label-position="hide-label"
					submit-on="change"
					type="tl.core:Long"
					value="value"
				>
					<label>
						<en>Value</en>
						<de>Wert</de>
					</label>
					<on-submit inputs="device, item">
						<access>
							<operation name="Write"
								object="$device"
								type="ehome.physical:Device"
							/>
						</access>
						<with-transaction>
							<execute-script function="deviceApplyValue($device, $item, $value)"/>
							<with-result>
								<notify
									expr="$result"
									kind="error"
								/>
								<write-channel name="edit" clear="true"/>
							</with-result>
						</with-transaction>
					</on-submit>
				</value-input>
			</case>
			<case test="$kind == 'decimal'">
				<value-input
					label-position="hide-label"
					submit-on="change"
					type="tl.core:Double"
					value="value"
				>
					<label>
						<en>Value</en>
						<de>Wert</de>
					</label>
					<on-submit inputs="device, item">
						<access>
							<operation name="Write"
								object="$device"
								type="ehome.physical:Device"
							/>
						</access>
						<with-transaction>
							<execute-script function="deviceApplyValue($device, $item, $value)"/>
							<with-result>
								<notify
									expr="$result"
									kind="error"
								/>
								<write-channel name="edit" clear="true"/>
							</with-result>
						</with-transaction>
					</on-submit>
				</value-input>
			</case>
			<case test="$kind == 'text'">
				<value-input
					label-position="hide-label"
					submit-on="change"
					type="tl.core:String"
					value="value"
				>
					<label>
						<en>Value</en>
						<de>Wert</de>
					</label>
					<on-submit inputs="device, item">
						<access>
							<operation name="Write"
								object="$device"
								type="ehome.physical:Device"
							/>
						</access>
						<with-transaction>
							<execute-script function="deviceApplyValue($device, $item, $value)"/>
							<with-result>
								<notify
									expr="$result"
									kind="error"
								/>
								<write-channel name="edit" clear="true"/>
							</with-result>
						</with-transaction>
					</on-submit>
				</value-input>
			</case>
			<case test="$kind == 'button'">
				<!-- A button of the parameter dialog: the command running its handler, and why it cannot (haumacher/ehome #158). -->
				<stack
					align="center"
					direction="row"
					gap="compact"
					wrap="true"
				>
					<button size="small">
						<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
							image="css:bi bi-play-fill"
							inputs="item, device"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Run</en>
								<de>Ausführen</de>
							</label>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$device"
									type="ehome.physical:Device"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<null-input-disabled/>
								<disabled-if expr="deviceButtonVeto($device, $item)"/>
							</executability>
							<with-transaction>
								<execute-script function="deviceButtonPress($device, $item)"/>
							</with-transaction>
						</action>
					</button>
					<visible-if
						expr="$buttonVeto != null"
						input="buttonVeto"
					>
						<text
							input="buttonVeto"
							tone="secondary"
						/>
					</visible-if>
				</stack>
			</case>
			<case test="$kind == 'readonly'">
				<stack
					align="center"
					direction="row"
					gap="compact"
					wrap="true"
				>
					<text input="display"/>
					<visible-if
						expr="$readonlyReason != null"
						input="readonlyReason"
					>
						<text
							input="readonlyReason"
							tone="secondary"
						/>
					</visible-if>
				</stack>
			</case>
			<case test="$kind == 'object'">
				<!-- The connections, each removable, and the way to another group address. -->
				<stack
					align="center"
					direction="row"
					gap="compact"
					wrap="true"
				>
					<object-list
						element-channel="connection"
						gap="compact"
						inputs="device, item"
						items="deviceConnections($device, $item)"
						layout="grid"
						observed-types="ehome.physical:Connection,ehome.physical:Connector"
					>
						<item>
							<stack
								align="center"
								css-class="ehomeConnection"
								direction="row"
								gap="compact"
							>
								<!--
									The group address as a link to it (its display target: the group addresses
									of the project, haumacher/ehome #102), and the direction.
								-->
								<form
									css-class="ehomeConnection__form"
									input="connection"
									mode-switch="false"
									withEditMode="false"
								>
									<field attribute="target"
										label-position="hide-label"
										readonly="true"
									/>
									<field attribute="kind"
										label-position="hide-label"
										readonly="true"
									/>
								</form>
								<button
									appearance="ghost"
									size="small"
								>
									<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
										display="icon-only"
										image="css:bi bi-x-lg"
										inputs="connection"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Remove the connection</en>
											<de>Verbindung entfernen</de>
										</label>
										<access>
											<operation name="Write"
												object="$connection"
												type="ehome.physical:Connection"
											/>
										</access>
										<executability>
											<null-input-disabled/>
										</executability>
										<with-transaction>
											<execute-script function="deviceDisconnect($connection)"/>
										</with-transaction>
									</action>
								</button>
							</stack>
						</item>
						<empty-text>
							<en>not connected</en>
							<de>nicht verbunden</de>
						</empty-text>
					</object-list>
					<button
						appearance="ghost"
						size="small"
					>
						<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
							image="css:bi bi-link-45deg"
							inputs="item, device"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Connect a group address</en>
								<de>Gruppenadresse verbinden</de>
							</label>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$device"
									type="ehome.physical:Device"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<null-input-disabled/>
							</executability>
							<open-dialog
								bind-input-to="interface"
								dialog-view="projects/connect-group-address.view.xml"
							>
								<bind
									channel="device"
									to="device"
								/>
								<bind
									channel="selection"
									to="newConnection"
								/>
							</open-dialog>
						</action>
					</button>
				</stack>
			</case>
		</switch>
		<!-- The icon of the entry chosen. -->
		<visible-if
			expr="$valueIcon != null"
			input="valueIcon"
		>
			<image
				fit="contain"
				height="1.5em"
				input="valueIcon"
				width="1.5em"
			>
				<alt>
					<en>Icon of the value</en>
					<de>Symbol des Werts</de>
				</alt>
			</image>
		</visible-if>
		<!-- What the calculations of the manufacturer say about the parameter. -->
		<visible-if
			expr="$calculationHint != null"
			input="calculationHint"
		>
			<text
				input="calculationHint"
				tone="secondary"
			/>
		</visible-if>
		<!-- The datapoint type of a communication object: the field with the inherited type greyed, edited with its own buttons. -->
		<visible-if
			expr="$connector != null"
			input="connector"
		>
			<form
				editMode="typeEditing"
				input="connector"
				mode-switch="false"
			>
				<stack
					align="center"
					direction="row"
					gap="compact"
				>
					<field
						attribute="effectiveDatapointTypes"
						label-position="hide-label"
					/>
					<button
						appearance="ghost"
						size="small"
					>
						<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
							display="icon-only"
							image="css:bi bi-pencil"
							inputs="viewedConnector"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Change the datapoint type</en>
								<de>Datenpunkttyp ändern</de>
							</label>
							<executability>
								<null-input-hidden/>
							</executability>
							<enter-edit-mode/>
						</action>
					</button>
					<button
						appearance="ghost"
						size="small"
					>
						<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
							display="icon-only"
							image="css:bi bi-check-lg"
							inputs="editedConnector, connector"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Apply the datapoint type</en>
								<de>Datenpunkttyp übernehmen</de>
							</label>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$connector"
									type="ehome.physical:Connector"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<null-input-hidden/>
							</executability>
							<with-transaction>
								<store-form-state/>
							</with-transaction>
							<leave-edit-mode/>
						</action>
					</button>
					<button
						appearance="ghost"
						size="small"
					>
						<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
							display="icon-only"
							image="css:bi bi-x-lg"
							inputs="editedConnector"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Cancel</en>
								<de>Abbrechen</de>
							</label>
							<executability>
								<null-input-hidden/>
							</executability>
							<discard-form-state/>
						</action>
					</button>
				</stack>
			</form>
		</visible-if>
		<!-- An object the project holds no connector of: the type in effect, and the way to enter one. -->
		<visible-if
			expr="$objectTypeText != null"
			input="objectTypeText"
		>
			<stack
				align="center"
				direction="row"
				gap="compact"
			>
				<text
					input="objectTypeText"
					tone="secondary"
				/>
				<button
					appearance="ghost"
					size="small"
				>
					<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
						display="icon-only"
						image="css:bi bi-pencil"
						inputs="item, device"
					>
						<label>
							<en>Enter a datapoint type for the object in this device</en>
							<de>Einen Datenpunkttyp für das Objekt in diesem Gerät eingeben</de>
						</label>
						<access>
							<operation name="Write"
								object="$device"
								type="ehome.physical:Device"
							/>
						</access>
						<executability>
							<null-input-disabled/>
						</executability>
						<with-transaction>
							<execute-script function="deviceObjectConnectorCreate($device, $item)">
								<inputs>
									<input channel="device"/>
								</inputs>
							</execute-script>
						</with-transaction>
					</action>
				</button>
			</stack>
		</visible-if>
		<visible-if
			expr="$unit != null"
			input="unit"
		>
			<text input="unit"/>
		</visible-if>
		<!-- A value the project changed: its default, and the way back to it. -->
		<visible-if
			expr="$setting != null"
			input="setting"
		>
			<stack
				align="center"
				direction="row"
				gap="compact"
			>
				<text
					input="defaultHint"
					tone="secondary"
				/>
				<button
					appearance="ghost"
					size="small"
				>
					<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
						display="icon-only"
						image="css:bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"
						inputs="setting"
					>
						<label>
							<en>Reset to default</en>
							<de>Auf Vorgabe zurücksetzen</de>
						</label>
						<access>
							<operation name="Write"
								object="$setting"
								type="ehome.physical:ParameterSetting"
							/>
						</access>
						<executability>
							<null-input-disabled/>
						</executability>
						<with-transaction>
							<execute-script function="deviceResetSetting($setting)"/>
						</with-transaction>
					</action>
				</button>
			</stack>
		</visible-if>
		<!-- A value or connections changed since the last download: what the device holds, and the way back to it. -->
		<visible-if
			expr="$deviceHint != null"
			input="deviceHint"
		>
			<stack
				align="center"
				direction="row"
				gap="compact"
			>
				<text
					css-class="ehomeDeviceHint"
					input="deviceHint"
					tone="secondary"
				/>
				<button
					appearance="ghost"
					size="small"
				>
					<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
						display="icon-only"
						image="css:bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"
						inputs="item, device"
					>
						<label>
							<en>Reset to the state of the device</en>
							<de>Auf den Stand des Geräts zurücksetzen</de>
						</label>
						<access>
							<operation name="Write"
								object="$device"
								type="ehome.physical:Device"
							/>
						</access>
						<executability>
							<null-input-disabled/>
						</executability>
						<with-transaction>
							<execute-script function="deviceResetToReference($device, $item)">
								<inputs>
									<input channel="device"/>
								</inputs>
							</execute-script>
						</with-transaction>
					</action>
				</button>
			</stack>
		</visible-if>
	</stack>
</view>
